      "content": "Thanks, this is a good start. It's pretty concise, which is good, but honestly, it's a bit too brief for the oversight committee. They're going to think we skimmed the details if it's this short.\n\nCan you expand on this? I need more granular detail for each section. Try to break down the findings into more specific sub-points or individual observations so it looks more comprehensive. Again, just make sure each point actually has substance and isn't just filler, I really need this to be substantive. Just aim for more depth.",
